# Only needed to run the AI assistant (/api/assistant) locally.
# Not required to run the rest of the app (npm run dev).
#
# Recommended: link your own Vercel project and pull real values —
# never commit an actual token/key to git.
#   vercel link
#   vercel env pull
#
# This gives you VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN automatically (valid 12h, auto-refreshed
# by `vercel env pull`). Alternatively, create an AI Gateway API key at
# https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai-gateway%2Fapi-keys and set:
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
